  "titleText": {
    "es": "Estoy muy entusiasmado con la misión Kepler. Es la segunda mejor cosa que ha hecho nuestra especie, justo detrás del concepto de pizza a domicilio.",
    "en": "I am so excited about the Kepler mission. This is the second most important thing our species has ever done, right behind inventing the concept of delivery pizza.",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive and official xkcd source both identify comic #638. The archive translates the official title text while retaining the Kepler mission name."
  },
