      "id": "word-rastreado",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "rastreado",
      "answerEn": "tracked; searched systematically",
      "noteEn": "Rastreado is the completed-action form of rastrear. After hemos, it describes a search carried out up to the present.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Hemos rastreado la zona.",
        "en": "We have searched the area."
      },
      "tags": [
