      "id": "word-habríamos--conditional-perfect",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "habríamos",
      "answerEn": "we would have",
      "noteEn": "Habríamos is the “we would have” form of the helper verb haber. It combines with a completed-action form such as visto.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Habríamos llegado antes.",
        "en": "We would have arrived earlier."
      },
      "tags": [
        "word",
        "haber",
        "conditional perfect",
        "B1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "word-colonia--ant-colony",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "colonia",
      "answerEn": "colony; organized group of ants",
      "noteEn": "In biology, colonia can name a group of organisms living together. For ants, it includes the cooperating ants and their nest community.",
